{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>iOS 27.3 將於下月向所有用戶推出，為 iPhone 內置應用程式帶來多項新功能及設計改動，涉及 Health、Calendar、Safari 及 Music，其中 Health 的改動最大。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"文章配圖\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1000\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Safari-Vertical-Tabs-iOS27-3-Duo.jpg\" width=\"2000\"/></figure>\n<h2>Health 改版三大標籤</h2>\n<p>Health 獲得最大的設計改動，引入全新的 Insights、Longevity 及 Browse 標籤，取代原有選項，並加入頂部導航列、個人化提示與指導、教育影片等多項新介面元素。</p>\n<h2>Calendar 按鈕移至底部</h2>\n<p>Calendar 的設計更新聚焦讓主要按鈕更易單手觸及。搜尋及建立新活動的按鈕由右上角移至螢幕底部；螢幕頂部會在當前月份旁顯示年份，並把 Today 按鈕改為顯示當前日期。</p>\n<h2>Safari 加入垂直標籤</h2>\n<p>Safari 引入可選的「垂直標籤」新設計，用戶可在「設定 ⇾ Apps ⇾ Safari」中啟用，於 iPhone、iPad 及 Mac 提供另一種標籤排列方式。</p>\n<h2>Music 歌詞封面融合</h2>\n<p>Apple Music 在 iOS 27.3 中為橫向查看歌詞帶來細微但美觀的設計更新。歌曲封面現在可突破方形限制，無縫融入滾動的歌詞檢視；這項歌詞檢視先前已在 <a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/tag/iPhone-Duo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">iPhone Duo</a> 提供，現在擴展至所有 iPhone。</p>\n<figure>\n<blockquote><p>New in iOS 27.3 Beta: Animated artwork blends into the Apple Music player in landscape mode, and it looks so good. <a href=\"https://t.co/k8rgSEALGo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">pic.twitter.com/k8rgSEALGo</a></p>— Beta Profiles (@BetaProfiles) <a href=\"https://x.com/BetaProfiles/status/2118031226191978622?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">November 4, 2026</a></blockquote>\n</figure>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T16:25:59.383720+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":721,"images":1,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T15:46:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T13:37:38.164378+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T16:19:16.611398+00:00","content_hash":"30f5c0038841beac74eebdbd252941c21a7e0c90d49a0bfc4192c7b223de3bfa","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}